# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored via the *.local rule.
#
# CARTO Basemaps key — https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
# Without it the map still renders, but CARTO stamps an "API KEY REQUIRED"
# watermark across every tile. Vite inlines this into the built bundle, so it is
# public once deployed: restrict it to your own domain in the CARTO dashboard.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
